<title>USA: Chrysler Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Chrysler Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>AUBURN HILLS, Mich. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.46		    $1.32</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.45		    $1.30</p>
<p> Net		    1,029,000		1,005,000</p>
<p> Revs		  16,116,000	     14,956,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     705,900		  760,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     708,400		  770,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES - '96 per-share data restated to reflect 2-for-1 stock split declared in Q2 '96.  </p>
<p>'97 Q1 worldwide factory shipments 781,239 units vs 753,176.</p>
<p>'97 Q1 automotive cash, marketable securities $7.62 billion vs $7.15 billion.</p>
<p>Chrysler Financial Corp Q1 net income $93 million vs $98 million.</p>
<p>'97 Q1 U.S., Canada car and truck market share 15.6 percent vs 16.3 percent.</p>
<p>'97 Q1 U.S., Canada retail unit (including fleet) sales 626,844 vs 644,678.</p>
